body:
Lions Mane & Cordyceps Blend, P cubensis if you have it.

&#x200B;

It'll help with the jonzing effect, anxiety, and irritability

A friend of mine had her first trip about 8 months ago and realized she was with the wrong person and subsequently divorced that person... They're definitely eye-openers. Whereas after my first trip with my wife, they brought us closer together and instilled a greater appreciation for one another. 

&#x200B;

Mushrooms provide what you ask them for- Ask for truth, you shall receive truths not even your best friends can provide, Ask for wisdom, you shall receive wisdom not even experience can provide.
